{"lesson_uid":"L0095","_provenance":{"generator":"backend/scripts/generate_lesson_zhuyin.py","reading_authority":"frontend/src/components/zhuyin/polyphonicProcessor.ts（跑，非移植）","source_font":"frontend/public/fonts/BpmfZihiSerif-Regular.ttf","font_sha256_16":"fc25a90d27699ec4","poyin_db_sha256_16":"2d4d4c9f1d0ec1a6","notation":"pypinyin BopomofoConverter（與 font_readings.json 同一個轉換器）","stats":{"texts":232,"chars":6312,"poly_positions":1404,"he_adjudicated":2,"xiang_adjudicated":0,"manual_corrections":0}},"texts":[{"section":"full_text_annotate","slug":"9yvqf","idx":1,"text":"聽到「科學怪人」四個字，很多人腦中會浮現頭上佈滿疤痕、臉部由不同肉塊縫合而成、眼窩深陷、身材魁梧的怪物。這位怪物出自英國作家瑪麗‧雪萊創作的小說，書名叫做《Frankenstein》（弗蘭肯斯坦），中文翻譯為《科學怪人》。","n":111,"ssz":".........1....................................................................................................."},{"section":"full_text_annotate","slug":"9yvqf","idx":2,"text":"小說中，弗蘭肯斯坦是一位充滿夢想的青年科學家，對探究生命起源相當迷戀。他為了瞭解「生」，長時間鑽到墓園觀察「死」，有一次，他發現腐敗的人體竟會發出一道轉瞬即逝的光芒，他回想起十五歲那年曾看過閃電劈毀一棵老橡樹，心中頓時出現了一個大膽的想法：「生命的起源來自於電」。他從電流中得到這個啟發，開始進行創新的「造人」實驗，他心想，如果成功製造出一個「人」，那該是多麼傑出的科學成就啊！","n":189,"ssz":"..........1...................1.....1.....................1..............1.........................2............11..........................1............................11.................."},{"section":"full_text_annotate","slug":"9yvqf","idx":3,"text":"他從此離群索居，祕密進行實驗，從停屍房和墓穴找來許多屍塊當作「實驗材料」，將屍塊縫補成人的形狀，幻想他自己可以扮演上帝的角色，讓冰冷的屍體甦醒過來。某個夜晚，他苦心製造的「人」居然慢慢睜開了枯黃遲滯的眼睛，開始吃力的呼吸，四肢不斷抽搐著。","n":119,"ssz":"...................1........................................1..............1.....................................1....."},{"section":"full_text_annotate","slug":"9yvqf","idx":4,"text":"弗蘭肯斯坦目睹這一刻，嚇得連連退後，他驚恐萬分，看著自己精心創造的「人」竟然如此恐怖，他淒厲的尖叫：「我創造了一個怪物啊！」接著奪門而出，留下這位身高八呎的怪物，好奇的開始對世界展開探索。","n":94,"ssz":"........1...1..........................................11........................1............"},{"section":"full_text_annotate","slug":"9yvqf","idx":5,"text":"換句話說，弗蘭肯斯坦成功的創造出一個「人」，但隨即拋棄了他。怪物被迫進入人類的世界，四處流浪，透過觀察學習，慢慢擁有知識，也學會判斷善惡、美醜，也希望被人類接納，卻因為醜陋無比的外表，一再遭受誤解與傷害，最後導致一連串的悲劇。","n":113,"ssz":"................11.........................1.......................................1........1.............2......"},{"section":"full_text_annotate","slug":"9yvqf","idx":6,"text":"每個人都有專屬於自己的名字，通常是由父母、家人所取名，一個名字的背後帶著取名之人的寄望、祝福。","n":47,"ssz":".1..........1..............11.1................"},{"section":"full_text_annotate","slug":"9yvqf","idx":7,"text":"人們常常誤以為書名的「弗蘭肯斯坦」指的是那位怪物，實際小說中，怪物並沒有名字，這也可以解讀為：他從未得到他人的認同與祝福。","n":61,"ssz":".....................................1......................."},{"section":"full_text_annotate","slug":"9yvqf","idx":8,"text":"小說的中文譯名是《科學怪人》，直接易懂，不過有人認為「科學怪人」是指怪物，也有人認為是那位瘋狂科學家，你認為呢？","n":56,"ssz":"....................1..................................."},{"section":"full_text_annotate","slug":"9yvqf","idx":9,"text":"這本小說還有一個副標題《The Modern Prometheus》（現代普羅米修斯）。傳說人類本來不知道如何用火，普羅米修斯是希臘神話裡的神祇，祂偷了眾神的火種，賜給人類，賦予人類力量。但偷火種觸犯了禁忌，祂也因此被鐵鍊鎖在高山上，長久遭受禿鷹啄食的懲罰。","n":129,"ssz":"......11........................................................................................................................."},{"section":"full_text_annotate","slug":"9yvqf","idx":10,"text":"作者雪萊把弗蘭肯斯坦比喻為「現代普羅米修斯」，是不是也意謂著弗蘭肯斯坦同樣觸犯了神的禁忌？他扮演了上帝的角色，利用拼湊縫補的屍塊，創造一個嶄新的生命，但也因此產生了一連串的悲劇。人類是否真的能「隻手遮天」，創造生命？這樣做，會不會受到上帝的懲罰？這些都引發後世讀者熱烈的討論。","n":138,"ssz":"........................1...........................1..............11.............2..............................1........................"},{"section":"full_text_annotate","slug":"9yvqf","idx":11,"text":"小說1818年出版至今已超過兩百年，多次被改編成影視作品。大家閱讀這本書時，難以忘懷怪物「出生」以來不斷發出渴望擁有愛的哀鳴，進而思考科學的發展是不是也該有一條倫理的界線。","n":86,"ssz":"..................................................1......................1....2......."},{"section":"key_reading","slug":"yqvaj","idx":null,"text":"他從此離群索居，祕密進行實驗，從停屍房和墓穴找來許多屍塊當作「實驗材料」，將屍塊縫補成人的形狀，幻想他自己可以扮演上帝的角色，讓冰冷的屍體甦醒過來。某個夜晚，他苦心製造的「人」居然慢慢睜開了枯黃遲滯的眼睛，開始吃力的呼吸，四肢不斷抽搐著。弗蘭肯斯坦目睹這一刻，嚇得連連退後，他驚恐萬分，看著自己精心創造的「人」竟然如此恐怖，他淒厲的尖叫：「我創造了一個怪物啊！」接著奪門而出，留下這位身高八呎的怪物，好奇的開始對世界展開探索。換句話說，弗蘭肯斯坦成功的創造出一個「人」，但隨即拋棄了他。怪物被迫進入人類的世界，四處流浪，透過觀察學習，慢慢擁有知識，也學會判斷善惡、美醜，也希望被人類接納，卻因為醜陋無比的外表，一再遭受誤解與傷害，最後導致一連串的悲劇。每個人都有專屬於自己的名字，通常是由父母、家人所取名，一個名字的背後帶著取名之人的寄望、祝福。","n":373,"ssz":"...................1........................................1..............1.....................................1.............1...1..........................................11........................1............................11.........................1.......................................1........1.............2.......1..........1..............11.1................"},{"section":"served:series","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"一般","n":2,"ssz":"2."},{"section":"served:title","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"科學怪人（弗蘭肯斯坦：現代普羅米修斯）","n":19,"ssz":"..................."},{"section":"served:genre","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"應用文","n":3,"ssz":"1.."},{"section":"served:reading_strategy","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"推論策略──從文本線索理解標題","n":15,"ssz":"..............."},{"section":"served:reading_strategy_explained","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"這一課我們要學著怎麼從文章裡面的線索，去猜測跟理解文章的標題\n為什麼要用《科學怪人》這篇文章呢？因為它有個特別的副標題「現代普羅米修斯」，這就好像一個小小的謎題，等你用文章裡的提示去解開\n讀的時候，你可以試著想想，為什麼作者會用「普羅米修斯」來形容這位科學家，文章裡又有哪些地方讓你這樣想呢","n":145,"ssz":".1.............................1.................1..1....................11................................1....................................."},{"section":"served:reading_strategy_explained#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"這一課我們要學著怎麼從文章裡面的線索，去猜測跟理解文章的標題","n":30,"ssz":".1............................"},{"section":"served:reading_strategy_explained#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"為什麼要用《科學怪人》這篇文章呢？因為它有個特別的副標題「現代普羅米修斯」，這就好像一個小小的謎題，等你用文章裡的提示去解開","n":62,"ssz":"1.................1..1....................11.................."},{"section":"served:reading_strategy_explained#line","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"讀的時候，你可以試著想想，為什麼作者會用「普羅米修斯」來形容這位科學家，文章裡又有哪些地方讓你這樣想呢","n":51,"ssz":".............1....................................."},{"section":"served:intro.background","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"這篇文章介紹了經典小說《科學怪人》（弗蘭肯斯坦）的故事。故事的主角是一位充滿野心的年輕科學家弗蘭肯斯坦，他著迷於生命的奧祕，並大膽嘗試創造生命。文章描述了他如何透過實驗製造出一個「人」，以及這個創造物誕生後所引發的一連串事件。同時，也探討了小說的副標題「現代普羅米修斯」的意涵，以及故事中關於科學倫理、生命創造和社會接納等引人深思的主題。","n":169,"ssz":"................................1.1..................3.................................11.......1..........2...............................................1............."},{"section":"served:manifest_sections[0].no","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"一","n":1,"ssz":"."},{"section":"served:manifest_sections[0].name","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"讀全文—做記號","n":7,"ssz":"......."},{"section":"served:manifest_sections[1].no","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"二","n":1,"ssz":"."},{"section":"served:manifest_sections[1].name","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"念順順","n":3,"ssz":"..."},{"section":"served:manifest_sections[2].no","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"三","n":1,"ssz":"."},{"section":"served:manifest_sections[2].name","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"語詞我最棒","n":5,"ssz":"....."},{"section":"served:manifest_sections[3].no","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"四","n":1,"ssz":"."},{"section":"served:manifest_sections[3].name","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"語詞應用","n":4,"ssz":"..1."},{"section":"served:manifest_sections[4].no","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"五","n":1,"ssz":"."},{"section":"served:manifest_sections[4].name","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"文章重點表","n":5,"ssz":"....."},{"section":"served:manifest_sections[5].no","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"六","n":1,"ssz":"."},{"section":"served:manifest_sections[5].name","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"閱讀聚光燈","n":5,"ssz":"....."},{"section":"served:manifest_sections[5].subtitle","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"推論策略——從文本線索理解標題","n":15,"ssz":"..............."},{"section":"served:manifest_sections[6].no","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"七","n":1,"ssz":"."},{"section":"served:manifest_sections[6].name","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"閱讀理解","n":4,"ssz":"...."},{"section":"served:manifest_sections[7].no","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"八","n":1,"ssz":"."},{"section":"served:manifest_sections[7].name","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"詞語複習","n":4,"ssz":"...."},{"section":"served:manifest_sections[8].no","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"九","n":1,"ssz":"."},{"section":"served:manifest_sections[8].name","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"知識補給站","n":5,"ssz":"...1."},{"section":"served:vocabulary[0].word","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"抽搐","n":2,"ssz":".."},{"section":"served:vocabulary[0].definition","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"肌肉不受控制的收縮、抖動。","n":13,"ssz":"..1.........."},{"section":"served:vocabulary[1].word","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"遲滯","n":2,"ssz":".."},{"section":"served:vocabulary[1].definition","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"緩慢、停止不動。","n":8,"ssz":".....1.."},{"section":"served:vocabulary[2].word","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"神祇","n":2,"ssz":".."},{"section":"served:vocabulary[2].definition","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"指神明。","n":4,"ssz":"...."},{"section":"served:vocabulary[3].word","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"離群索居","n":4,"ssz":"...."},{"section":"served:vocabulary[3].definition","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"離開人群，自己生活。","n":10,"ssz":".........."},{"section":"served:vocabulary[4].word","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"魁梧","n":2,"ssz":".."},{"section":"served:vocabulary[4].definition","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"體格高大強壯。","n":7,"ssz":"......."},{"section":"served:vocabulary[5].word","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"奪門而出","n":4,"ssz":"...."},{"section":"served:vocabulary[5].definition","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"迅速衝出大門。「奪」是指衝出去的意思。","n":19,"ssz":".................2."},{"section":"served:vocabulary[6].word","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"禁忌","n":2,"ssz":".."},{"section":"served:vocabulary[6].definition","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"因為風俗習慣或想法，而被禁止說的話或做的事。","n":22,"ssz":".1...................."},{"section":"served:vocabulary[7].word","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"轉瞬即逝","n":4,"ssz":"...."},{"section":"served:vocabulary[7].definition","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"一眨眼間就消失不見。","n":10,"ssz":"2......1.."},{"section":"served:vocabulary[8].word","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"隻手遮天","n":4,"ssz":"...."},{"section":"served:vocabulary[8].definition","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"想用一隻手遮住天，比喻隱瞞事實的真相。","n":19,"ssz":"..2................"},{"section":"served:vocabulary[9].word","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"倫理","n":2,"ssz":".."},{"section":"served:vocabulary[9].definition","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"判斷一件事應不應該做、做法是否合宜的","n":18,"ssz":"..1..............."},{"section":"served:vocabulary[10].word","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"哀鳴","n":2,"ssz":".."},{"section":"served:vocabulary[10].definition","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"因痛苦或悲傷而發出的叫聲。","n":13,"ssz":"............."},{"section":"served:fill_in_blank[0].sentence","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"她厭倦了都市嘈雜的生活，決定隱居山林，過著（　）的生活。","n":28,"ssz":"....1......................."},{"section":"served:fill_in_blank[1].sentence","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"老人對兒孫說，歳月（　），你們一定要珍惜和家人相處的機會。","n":29,"ssz":"...............1....1..1....."},{"section":"served:fill_in_blank[2].sentence","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"因為颱風，學校的校舍工程進度嚴重（　），恐怕無法及時完工。","n":29,"ssz":".1..........................."},{"section":"served:fill_in_blank[3].sentence","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"他做了一個錯誤的決策，還想（　），扭曲事實的真相。","n":25,"ssz":"...11...................."},{"section":"served:fill_in_blank[4].sentence","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"他的身材（　），又經過專業的武術訓練，十分適合擔任保全人員。","n":30,"ssz":".............................."},{"section":"served:fill_in_blank[5].sentence","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"他因為緊張過度，嘴角微微（　），臉上表情極不自然。","n":25,"ssz":"..1..................1..."},{"section":"served:fill_in_blank[6].sentence","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"進入寺廟參觀時，要尊重當地的（　），不要大聲喧嘩或隨意拍照。","n":30,"ssz":"..................1..........."},{"section":"served:fill_in_blank[7].sentence","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"受傷的小狗躲在牆角低聲（　），讓路過的人聽了很心疼。","n":26,"ssz":".........................."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[0].question","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"請問怪物的名字是什麼？","n":11,"ssz":"......1...."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[0].options[0]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"弗蘭肯斯坦","n":5,"ssz":"....."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[0].options[1]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"瑪麗•雪萊","n":5,"ssz":"....."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[0].options[2]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"普羅米修斯","n":5,"ssz":"....."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[0].options[3]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"怪物沒有名字","n":6,"ssz":".....1"},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[1].question","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"下列哪個句子中的語詞運用錯誤？","n":15,"ssz":"...1.1........."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[1].options[0]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"夫妻大吵一架後，這位太太一時氣不過便「奪門而出」","n":24,"ssz":"....1......12..1........"},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[1].options[1]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"陽光太強，小美一手提東西，只好「隻手遮天」擋住陽光","n":25,"ssz":".......2................."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[1].options[2]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"為了準備國家考試，他「離群索居」，專心讀書了三個月","n":25,"ssz":"1......................1."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[1].options[3]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"這外國人不了解台灣的「禁忌」，居然用紅筆寫信給友人","n":25,"ssz":".....1..................."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[2].question","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"根據文章，下列敘述何者不正確？","n":15,"ssz":"...........1..."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[2].options[0]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"弗蘭肯斯坦因爲想起曾看見樹被閃電擊中的景象，而得到用電流進行造人實驗的靈感","n":37,"ssz":"......1.............................."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[2].options[1]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"雖然弗蘭肯斯坦成功的造出「人」來，但隨後就被自己創造出來的「人」嚇得奪門而出","n":38,"ssz":".................................1...."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[2].options[2]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"怪物透過學習，慢慢擁有知識和判斷力，起初被討厭，最終因他的善良而被人類接納","n":37,"ssz":".............1......................."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[2].options[3]","slug":null,"idx":null,"text":"小說的中文翻譯是《科學怪人》，有人認為「科學怪人」是指怪物，也有人認為是科學家","n":39,"ssz":"......................................."},{"section":"served:multiple_choice[3].question","slug":